# Game audio — the voice clips are still Deltarune assets and are not
# redistributable, so they stay out of the repo until original sounds replace
# them. Drop your own into assets/kawkaw/ to hear anything; the overlay runs
# silently without them. The sprite sheet is original artwork and IS tracked.
*.ogg
*.wav

